{"id":"dwarf_wiki_background_001","npc":"dwarf","title":"矮人 Dwarf: background","tags":["dwarf","identity"],"aliases":["身份","mines","shop","merchant"],"priority":1,"text":"矮人 Dwarf 在矿洞的商店经营买卖。原版需要理解矮人语才能正常交流；聊天系统的人设不是已经完成语言解锁的证明。","source_url":"https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Dwarf","source_section":"Introduction / Relationships","retrieved_at":"2026-09-15","content_kind":"canonical_summary_with_runtime_caveats","review_status":"source_checked_needs_human_review","scope":"base_game"}
{"id":"dwarf_wiki_life_001","npc":"dwarf","title":"矮人 Dwarf: life","tags":["dwarf","life"],"aliases":["文化","dwarves","shadow","people","war"],"priority":1,"text":"矮人与暗影族 shadow people 有历史冲突，科罗布斯 Krobus 属于暗影族。不要虚构战争年代或声称当前玩家已经触发双方和解事件。","source_url":"https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Dwarf","source_section":"Relationships / Dialogue / Services / Events","retrieved_at":"2026-09-15","content_kind":"canonical_summary_with_runtime_caveats","review_status":"source_checked_needs_human_review","scope":"base_game"}
